<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the Developer ID build of Awai Drive.
  Intentionally empty. The app is not sandboxed, so outbound network needs no
  com.apple.security.network.client entitlement, and the WKWebView JIT runs in
  WebKit's own process. The login-Keychain items (`network.awai.drive.vault`,
  see src/desktop_vault.rs) use the legacy file keychain, whose access is bound
  to this app's designated requirement (Team ID + bundle ID), so no
  keychain-access-groups entitlement or provisioning profile is needed.
  See docs/macos-signing.md before adding an entitlement.
-->
